SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

This licence covers the code in this repository only.

It does not cover the JTH (Job Tracking History) dataset, which is third-party
research data published by Romero, Millet and Behar under CC BY-NC 4.0 and is not
redistributed here. The JTH data files are deliberately absent from this
repository; `etl/fetch.py` downloads them from the publisher's Zenodo record. The
dataset card reproduced at `docs/upstream/dataset_card.md` remains the publisher's
work under CC BY-NC 4.0 and is included for attribution and for the contract
checks that read their expectations from it.

JTH's licence forbids commercial use and de-anonymisation. Nothing in this licence
grants either.
